  "title": "Beer Nut Cookies",
  "description": "Beer nut cookies are quick and easy to make; if you don&#39;t have beer nuts, these are also good with honey-roasted or salted nuts.",
  "authors": [
    "Kevin Ryan"
  ],
  "date_published": "1998-05-08T18:36:01-04:00",
